{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Works the Evening Shift", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Chatting With Vanessa", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " On the Phone", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Talking on the phone in your second language can be a challenge. In English, there are certain common polite phrases you use to start and end a conversation, especially in a business context.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Sometimes you might have limited time to be on the phone because you have work to do or you get interrupted. It's important to manage a phone conversation to suit your needs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here are some phrases you can use to end a phone conversation in a polite way:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'm sorry, but I have to go.<br/> Look, I have to get back to work. / I have something cooking on the stove. / I need to get back to my kids.<br/> Listen, I'm running out of time. / It's getting late.</span></span><br/> ... followed by<br/> <span class=\"italic\">Can we talk about this later?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It's good to start with <span class=\"italic\">\u201cI'm sorry, but ... \u201d</span> to be apologetic about cutting the conversation short.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you know the person well, saying <span class=\"italic\">\u201cLook\u201d</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u201cListen\u201d</span> catches the other person's attention.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here are some phrases for starting and ending a phone call.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Receiver\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"> Receiver</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Caller</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Greeting/ Inquiring\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hello.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Hello, this is Jason. Could I speak to Aidan please?</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Sure. Just a moment please.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Thank you.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Starting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Hi, Jason. How are you?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Pretty good. How are you?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Ending\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'm sorry, but I have to go.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> No problem. I'll talk to you later.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" End Greeting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Alright. Thanks. Take care.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> You, too. See you soon. Bye.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Phrasal Verbs about Phone Communication", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " A phrasal verb is a phrase formed with a verb + preposition. Some phrasal verbs are unique to communication on the phone.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " Look at the following list of phrasal verbs. Try to use some of these the next time you're on the phone.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\"> Phrasal Verb</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Meaning</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call up/ring up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call and try to reach someone on the phone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to get through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to succeed in speaking to someone on the phone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to set up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to arrange another call or video chat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to hang on/to hold on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to wait for a short time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to put through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to connect a caller to someone in the office\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to pick up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to answer a phone call\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I'd better call up my boss. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Let's set up another call again. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "live", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to see someone or something on a screen in real time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Vanessa's dad was happy to see her live while he was talking with her.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about Internet communication.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "video chat", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a conversation with someone through the computer screen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: While you're at the hospital, it's nice to be able to do a video chat with family members.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "data", "type": "name"}, {"content": " information such as text, images or video that is sent through the Internet", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Internet service is so much more advanced now that we can send a lot of data quickly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to transmit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to send through cable lines or through the Internet", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: With high speed Internet, we can now transmit images and video quickly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to be up with", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be updated with a certain type of information or new trend", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm not up with all this new technology.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "neat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "interesting; fascinating", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's neat to be able to see someone live while chatting with them.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to manage", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to look after or to supervise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Vanessa has had a lot of pressure managing her staff.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to keep up", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to maintain progress or meet a standard", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm keeping up with the demands of managing the staff.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a short phone conversation that asks about work.  Write 8 - 10 lines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Set up a meeting or ask about a presentation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use phrases you've learned to start the conversation and end the conversation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice this dialogue with your partner. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "After practicing a few times looking at the dialogue on the page, do it again without looking at your page.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue that talks about work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use proper expressions to start and end a phone conversation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I become familiarized with dialogue expressions.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "q